        descD (:py:obj:`~.hiptensorTensorDescriptor`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Descriptor containing D's data type, modes, and strides. Currently must be identical to descC.

        modeD (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.ListOfInt`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Host memory array of size descD->numModes with D's mode names.

        opAB (:py:obj:`~.hiptensorOperator_t`) -- *IN*:
