            Scaling factor for A. Host memory pointer.

        A (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.Pointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Multi-mode tensor in GPU-accessible memory. Must not overlap with elements written to D.

        beta (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.Pointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Scaling factor for B. Host memory pointer.

        B (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.Pointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Multi-mode tensor in GPU-accessible memory. Must not overlap with elements written to D.

        gamma (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.Pointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Scaling factor for C. Host memory pointer.

        C (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.Pointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Multi-mode tensor in GPU-accessible memory. Must not overlap with elements written to D.

        D (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.Pointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *OUT*:
            Multi-mode tensor in GPU-accessible memory. C and D may be identical only if descC == descD.

        stream (:py:obj:`~.rocm.bindings.util.types.Pointer`/:py:obj:`~.object`) -- *IN*:
            Stream for performing the operation.

    Returns:
        A :py:obj:`~.tuple` of size 1 that contains (in that order):

        * :py:obj:`~.hiptensorStatus_t`: One of:
                - :py:obj:`~.HIPTENSOR_STATUS_NOT_SUPPORTED`: When data type combinations or operations aren't supported
                - :py:obj:`~.HIPTENSOR_STATUS_INVALID_VALUE`: When tensor dimensions or modes contain illegal values
                - :py:obj:`~.HIPTENSOR_STATUS_SUCCESS`: When the operation completes successfully
                - :py:obj:`~.HIPTENSOR_STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED`: When the handle isn't initialized.

    .. rubric:: C signature

